ad7f5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。漫画の画風がかわいいですね朝起きて、おやつに綿あめを食べて、赤面するほど可愛くて綺麗なBL小説を読んで、それを王子と同じ大きさのペットのフクロウが見ていて、フクロウがBL小説を読んでいる王子を引っ掻いて、王子は笑顔で汗をかいている😅この表情が好きで、フクロウに「もうしないでね」と約束して、街や森を散歩して、また綿あめを食べて、最後にあくびをしているところを、あなたのスタイルで見てみたいです。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1Dlin0tN31WXmIwEAqzIG8aCjv1q2C1Yj/view?usp=drivesdk", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nekura_neko/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f02d80ee/requests/267030_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0afdbcff02571a43ed569246e1024f2b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f02d80ee/requests/267030_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0afdbcff02571a43ed569246e1024f2b, https://si.imgix.net/f02d80ee/requests/267030_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7adca954e0aea252be2dc331d79f7d68 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f02d80ee/requests/267030_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=23bacbe033476e176ab86968ee5b6758 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! \nCan you please make some panels of my vtuber character: https://twitter.com/CHAOSVtuber/status/1348383009129582595\n\nI'd like it to be \"we are on a date\" style. \n1) panel where I'm feeding the reader at a cafe\n2) panel where I'm receiving a gift from reader and blushing\n3) panel where I'm asking for a hug from reader and embarrassed\n4) panel where I'm receiving a compliment and blushing\n\nMy character is a tsundere, who blushes easily and loves to be spoiled. Please make her embarrassed and sweet~ \nYou can put her in a different \"casual date\" outfit if it is easier for you.\n\nThank you so much!\n\nhttps://twitter.com/CHAOSVtuber/status/1348383009129582595", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nekura_neko/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a1911035/requests/232866_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=we